('flights','Flight research & coordination','travel','Flight options shaped around route, timing, cabin preference and budget.','["Domestic and international comparisons","Fare, duration, layover and baggage details","Reservation coordination after approval","Itinerary records and change support"]','A clear view of options before you authorize a booking.',true,1),
('accommodation','Hotel & accommodation research','travel','Accommodation options selected for location, comfort and practical needs.','["Hotel and extended-stay research","Location, price and cancellation comparisons","Reservation follow-up","Confirmation and deadline tracking"]','Stay close to the people, places and work that brought you there.',true,2),
('travel','Complete travel coordination','travel','One coordinated itinerary for a business or personal trip.','["Flights, stays and ground transport","Meeting, restaurant and event scheduling","Consolidated itinerary","Travel reminders and disruption support within agreed hours"]','A single point of contact from planning through the return.',true,3),
('ground','Airport transfers & ground transport','travel','Reliable transport options and clear pickup details.','["Airport pickup and drop-off","Driver and rental research","Hotel, office and venue transfers","Pickup schedules and provider details"]','Know where to be, when to be there, and who is meeting you.',true,4),
('personal','Personal assistance & lifestyle coordination','executive-support','Remote coordination for selected personal responsibilities.','["Personal calendar and appointments","Restaurant, event and activity research","Gift and shopping research","Approved errands and follow-ups"]','Keep personal plans moving without adding another task to your day.',true,5),
('reservations','Restaurants, events & reservations','travel','Research and reservation coordination for business occasions and time away.','["Restaurant and venue research","Business dinners and event spaces","Guest list and RSVP coordination","Reservation details and reminders"]','Arrive with the details settled and the right people informed.',true,6),
('visa','Visa research & travel documentation','travel','Administrative preparation based on official destination guidance.','["Links to official requirements","Travel document checklists","Deadline and appointment reminders","Organization of non-sensitive records"]','Understand preparation steps before you begin an application.',true,7),
('lead-gen','Lead research & appointment setting','business-operations','Prospect research and respectful outreach coordination.','["Prospect research against an agreed profile","Contact and company information","Outreach and follow-up scheduling","Appointment coordination and summaries"]','Spend more time in useful conversations with a clearer pipeline.',true,8),
('customer-support','Customer support & client relationships','business-operations','Coordination that helps customers receive a timely, considered response.','["Shared inbox monitoring and response drafts","Customer request updates","Follow-up scheduling","Recurring issue summaries"]','Give each customer a dependable experience as work grows.',true,9),
('operations','Business operations & project coordination','business-operations','Practical coordination across projects, people, deadlines and recurring processes.','["Project plans and deadline tracking","Meeting scheduling and follow-ups","Process documentation and checklists","Status summaries and action visibility"]','Keep commitments visible and work progressing between meetings.',true,10),
('marketing','Social media & digital marketing support','digital-workflows','Behind-the-scenes support for a consistent marketing rhythm.','["Content calendars and publishing coordination","Asset organization and draft preparation","Campaign and competitor research","Activity reporting"]','Maintain a steady presence without losing sight of the work behind it.',true,11),
('automation','AI tools & workflow automation','digital-workflows','Research and setup of practical tools for repetitive, well-defined work.','["Workflow review","Tool research and setup coordination","Prompt and process documentation","Human review and handoff guidance"]','Reduce repeat work while keeping important decisions in human hands.',true,12),
('research','Research, data & reporting','business-operations','Organized research and records that make the next decision easier.','["Online research from agreed sources","Spreadsheet cleanup","Competitor and supplier comparisons","Concise reports and summaries"]','Move from scattered information to something you can act on.',true,13),
('expenses','Expense organization & admin finance support','business-operations','Administrative organization for routine expense records and finance workflows.','["Receipt collection and categorization","Expense summaries","Invoice and payment reminders","Records prepared for your finance professional"]','See routine financial admin clearly and keep records ready for review.',true,14)
insert into public.faqs (question,answer,active,sort_order) values
('What can I ask for help with?','Support can be a single defined task, a short project, or an ongoing monthly arrangement across executive administration, travel, personal assistance, business operations and digital support.',true,0),
('Can you book flights and hotels directly?','I can research options and coordinate reservations with your authorization. Availability and prices may change. A booking is confirmed only after the supplier issues confirmation.',true,1),
('Do you work with clients internationally?','The service is designed for remote collaboration across time zones. Working hours and response windows are agreed during onboarding.',true,2),
('Can I start with one task?','Yes. Send a request with the outcome and deadline. I will confirm fit, scope and fees before work starts.',true,3),
('How is pricing set?','The monthly figures shown are draft starting prices. Actual fees depend on scope, hours, urgency and third-party costs; you receive a proposal for approval first.',true,4),
('Are travel costs included in the support fee?','No. Your service fee is separate from fares, accommodation, transport and supplier charges. Any booking requires your approval and follows the provider’s terms.',true,5),
('How do you handle confidential information?','Requests are kept to the information needed. Do not submit passport numbers, card details or sensitive documents through the public form.',true,6),
('What are your working hours and availability?','Availability, time-zone overlap, response windows and urgent-request coverage are agreed before work begins. No round-the-clock availability is implied.',true,7),
('How do travel coordination fees work?','The service fee is quoted separately from fares, accommodation, transfers and other supplier costs. The scope and fee are shared for approval before any reservation request proceeds.',true,8),
('Which payment methods do you accept?','Payment method and schedule are confirmed in the proposal before work starts. No payment card details should be sent through this website.',true,9),
('Can you help with cancellations or rebooking?','I can help coordinate requests with the relevant supplier, subject to that provider’s rules, availability and fees. Changes are not confirmed until the supplier confirms them.',true,10),
('Can we schedule a consultation?','Send a contact request with your time zone and preferred communication method. A suitable time can be arranged in the follow-up; a scheduling link can be added once the business calendar is configured.',true,11),
('What happens after I send a request?','I review requirements, clarify budget and timing, then send a proposed scope and fee. Work starts after you approve the proposal and onboarding conditions.',true,12)
